---
dateModified: "2026-10-04"
layout: base.njk
title: "Booking Software Nepal | Spa, Salon & Gym Management System | Zennly"
metaDescription: "Online booking and management software for spas, beauty parlours, salons, gyms and clinics in Nepal. Multi-branch scheduling, discount approval and daily reconciliation."
