        <div><p class="v2-ocpanel__eyebrow">Scheduling</p><h3>Zero double-bookings, enforced by the system.</h3><p>Zennly checks the staff member, the room and the duration before a slot is confirmed. If it can't fit, it won't book.</p><div class="v2-ocpanel__instead">Instead of <span>Paper diaries</span><span>Clashing rooms</span><span>Morning check-in calls</span></div></div>
        <div class="v2-ocpanel__visual v2-ocpanel__visual--ui">{% image "/assets/images/feat-bookings-real.png", "Zennly day calendar with bookings per therapist", { loading: "lazy", sizes: "(max-width: 980px) 90vw, 640px" } %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-ocpanel" role="tabpanel" id="v2-ocpanel-close" aria-labelledby="v2-tab-close" hidden>
        <div><p class="v2-ocpanel__eyebrow">Daily close</p><h3>Close the day in 30 seconds, not 30 minutes.</h3><p>Revenue, discounts and payments by cash, card and online add up as they happen. Close the day and it's locked from edits.</p><div class="v2-ocpanel__instead">Instead of <span>Excel sheets</span><span>End-of-day guesswork</span></div></div>
        <div class="v2-ocpanel__visual v2-ocpanel__visual--ui">{% image "/assets/images/feat-finance.png", "Daily revenue close by payment method", { loading: "lazy", sizes: "(max-width: 980px) 90vw, 640px" } %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v2-ocpanel" role="tabpanel" id="v2-ocpanel-discounts" aria-labelledby="v2-tab-discounts" hidden>
        <div><p class="v2-ocpanel__eyebrow">Discount control</p><h3>Every discount approved. Every rupee traced.</h3><p>Staff request a discount with a reason; managers approve it from their phone. Everything is logged, so nothing leaks.</p><div class="v2-ocpanel__instead">Instead of <span>Unapproved discounts</span><span>Mismatched notes</span></div></div>
