<section class="v2-section v2-sheet v2-sheet--cream v2-beliefs" aria-label="Our beliefs">
  <div class="v2-wrap v2-beliefs__grid">
    <div class="v2-beliefs__left v2-reveal">
      <h2 class="v2-h2">3 beliefs that guide our company</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="v2-reveal">
        <div class="v2-belief"><h3>We believe your numbers should close themselves.</h3><div><p>Most service businesses still end the day with a calculator and a spreadsheet. That's hours a week spent checking work the system should already know.</p><p>In Zennly, bookings, payments and discounts add up as they happen. Closing the day takes seconds, and the numbers are right.</p></div></div>
        <div class="v2-belief"><h3>We believe in controls, not trust-me.</h3><div><p>When discounts and refunds live in notebooks and chat threads, money leaks and good staff get blamed for it.</p><p>Every discount in Zennly has a reason, a limit and an approval. Owners get the full picture; staff get a clear process.</p></div></div>
